    "Avoid special characters like em dashes (—) in prefix, suffix, or comments. They may cause metadata to not be written correctly." : {
      "comment" : "A tooltip explaining the importance of not using special characters in the prefix, suffix, or comments.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unngå spesialtegn som tankestrek (—) i prefiks, suffiks eller kommentarer. Det kan føre til at metadata ikke blir skrevet riktig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By default, metadata such as title, timecode, and encoder tags are stripped to keep output files clean. Color-related metadata (including HDR) is always preserved for accurate viewing." : {
      "comment" : "A tooltip explaining that color-related metadata is always preserved for accurate viewing.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Som standard blir metadata som tittel, tidskode og kodertagger fjernet for å holde utdatafilene rene. Fargerelatert metadata (inkludert HDR) blir alltid bevart for nøyaktig visning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
